# AES-128-GCM — SimpleOS NVFS crypto adapter.
#
# CANONICAL SOURCE: src/os/crypto/aes128_gcm.spl in the main Simple repo.
# This migrated copy exists until NVFS imports the canonical OS crypto module
# directly in all interpreter and native test lanes.
#
# FR-NVFS-N6a-002: once the direct OS crypto import is enabled,
# delete this file and replace with:
#   use os.crypto.aes128_gcm.{aes128_gcm_encrypt, aes128_gcm_decrypt, Aes128GcmResult}
